[00:15.72]1. The heavens tell the glory of Jehovah.
[00:29.00]The work of his own hand,
[00:33.24]we see in skies above.
[00:42.10]And each new day brings to him rightful praise.
[00:52.36]The starlit night proclaims his might,
[00:59.62]His wisdom, and his love.
[01:12.40]2. Jehovah’s law is perfect, life-restoring,
[01:23.84]And his reminders guide
[01:28.44]the steps of old and young.
[01:34.50]His rulings prove to be true, right, and just.
[01:44.06]His word is sure, his law so pure,
[01:53.42]So sweet upon the tongue.
[02:00.30]3. The fear of God is pure and lasts forever.
[02:10.86]The worth of his commands
[02:16.68]exceeds the finest gold.
[02:20.64]His orders lead and preserve all his own.
[02:31.00]His honor, fame, and holy name,
[02:41.48]We loyally uphold.
